There should be a toggle in the top-right of SCR-001-board, with a label "Vertex values". When this is on, any settlements and cities are hidden. Instead, on each vertex is a black circle with a white number, showing the sum of the pips in the three adjoining hexagons. If this is above a settlement, the circle is surrounded by a thin ring of that colour. If on a city, it has 2 thin rings of that colour.
